description=Optional add-on for GoM Extension: Guns of Tien with eight guns from after July 1993: the H&K MP7 (in the main mod's short SMG stance) and the FN P90 TR (held like a pistol), the FN Five-seveN pistol, the H&K UCP Prototype pistol, the FN SCAR-L and SCAR-H rifles and the H&K UMP45 and UMP9 submachine guns, with their magazines (MP7 20, 30, 40 and a 60-round drum; P90 50; Five-seveN 20 and 30; UCP 20 and a 40-round drum; SCAR-H 20, 10 and a 50-round drum, the SCAR-L takes Guns of Marz's STANAG magazines; UMP45 25, 20 and 10; UMP9 30), suppressors, and 4.6x30mm and 5.7x28mm ammunition, which can also be made with Ammo Maker (optional). Enable it together with GoM Extension: Guns of Tien.
